tual+Awakening+Music+For+Prayer+and+Spiritual+Body+Healing", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Spiritual+Awakening+Music+For+Prayer+and+Spiritual+Body+Healing&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": []}, {"t": 7107, "time": "01:58:27", "artist": "Juls & Luedji Luna", "title": "Com Amor Bahia", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1815974033", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Juls+%26+Luedji+Luna+Com+Amor+Bahia&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2025 TABOM RECORDS"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 3, "low": 4}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:03:45", "end": "00:04:02", "text": "Kitta or. Tu le monde a décalé Konakry, Kahn. A décalé Chocor. Tu le monde a décalé Abidjan. A décalé Walo. Walo, c'est fini. Le pistolero."}, {"start": "00:59:23", "end": "00:59:46", "text": "I've been silent, breathing, spent a couple G's from the SS season, sealed another deal and made it back, easy. I still got bangs out in Paris trying to meet me, had this French guy talking to me in Swahili, said he got that ribbon now bumping out. Wanted an autograph so I put it on the CD, you never get used to that feeling. I took a break after the drop to let you catch up but still."}, {"start": "01:01:06", "end": "01:01:27", "text": "When it's a vision of a dream, a winning is constant. Encoded in me, my purpose was never a concept. Nylogy embodies the spirit of a prophet. So know when I stand with the ministers and the MPs, I still know the guys that roll in 16D. They call that code, switch it, yes, I learn to flip the keys. Silence isn't a weakness, but God is the machine."}, {"start": "01:16:18", "end": "01:16:44", "text": "Caustically comparing myself to others. There's no other. But you know, you know how it goes. Pretty much detrimental. It's also just part of life, part of being a human being. Reading this book, it's called self-doubt."}, {"start": "01:17:14", "end": "01:17:54", "text": "We'll see you next time."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:26:00"}, "track": {"title": "Supernova", "artists": [{"name": "Bandēs"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:44:28"}, "track": {"title": "I wonder", "artists": [{"name": "Bb trickz"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:02:00"}, "track": {"title": "Skriker mitt namn", "artists": [{"name": "Victor Leksell"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:07:00"}, "track": {"title": "Whay?", "artists": [{"name": "GIULIANO V"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:07:48"}, "track": {"title": "That Chair", "artists": [{"name": "Mess Esque"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:45:00"}, "track": {"title": "Music For Prayer and Spiritual Body Healing", "artists": [{"name": "Spiritual Awakening"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:58:27"}, "track": {"title": "Com Amor Bahia", "artists": [{"name": "Juls & Luedji Luna"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}]}